#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L131
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:131
msgid ""
"The DSCA public key certificate of a GDHCN Participants (could be more than "
"one). The DSCA is a certificate which acts a trust anchor in the "
"verification of the certificate chain for the DSCs issued by a Trust Network"
" Participant\""
msgstr ""
"Le certificat de clé publique DSCA d’un participant au GDHCN (il peut y en "
"avoir plusieurs). Le DSCA est un certificat qui fait office d’ancre de "
"confiance dans la vérification de la chaîne de certificats des DSC émis par "
"un participant au réseau de confiance\""

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L101
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:101
msgid ""
"The GDHCN currently supports two means for key distribution of keys using "
"trust lists"
msgstr ""
"Le GDHCN prend actuellement en charge deux moyens de distribution des clés "
"au moyen de listes de confiance"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L6
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:6
msgid ""
"The GDHCN Trust Network is a Trust Network comprised of the GDHCN "
"Secretariat and GDHCN Participants. The GDHCN Trust Network operationalizes "
"Trust Domains through a Trust Network Gateway by enabling bilateral "
"verification and utilization of Verifiable Digital Health Certificates and "
"the utilization of Trusted Services by GDHCN Participants."
msgstr ""
"Le réseau de confiance du GDHCN est un réseau de confiance composé du "
"Secrétariat du GDHCN et des participants au GDHCN. Le réseau de confiance du"
" GDHCN rend opérationnels les domaines de confiance au moyen d’une "
"passerelle du réseau de confiance, en permettant la vérification et "
"l’utilisation bilatérales des certificats de santé numériques vérifiables "
"ainsi que l’utilisation des services de confiance par les participants au "
"GDHCN."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L46
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:46
msgid ""
"The individual designated by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary "
"overall responsibility for the security, technical matters and systems "
"infrastructure of this GDHCN Participant for the applicable Trust Domain "
"including ensuring compliance with technical specifications."
msgstr ""
"Personne désignée par un participant au GDHCN comme ayant la responsabilité "
"globale principale de la sécurité, des questions techniques et de "
"l’infrastructure des systèmes de ce participant au GDHCN pour le domaine de "
"confiance applicable, y compris du respect des spécifications techniques."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L43
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:43
msgid ""
"The individual designated by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary "
"responsibility for reviewing the requirements related to a Trust Domain on "
"behalf of this GDHCN Participant. This person should be someone that the "
"GDHCN Secretariat can consult in relation to any legal or policy issues that"
" may arise, such as changes to this document or changes to one of its "
"Annexes that defines a Trust Domain."
msgstr ""
"Personne désignée par un participant au GDHCN comme ayant la responsabilité "
"principale d’examiner les exigences relatives à un domaine de confiance pour"
" le compte de ce participant au GDHCN. Cette personne devrait être une "
"personne que le Secrétariat du GDHCN peut consulter sur toute question "
"juridique ou politique qui pourrait survenir, telle que les modifications "
"apportées au présent document ou à l’une de ses annexes qui définit un "
"domaine de confiance."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L37
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:37
msgid ""
"The individual identified by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary "
"business and programmatic responsibility for the GDHCN Participant for the "
"implementation of the use cases covered by a Trust Domain."
msgstr ""
"Personne identifiée par un participant au GDHCN comme ayant la "
"responsabilité institutionnelle et programmatique principale du participant "
"au GDHCN pour la mise en œuvre des cas d’utilisation couverts par un domaine"
" de confiance."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L40
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:40
msgid ""
"The individual identified by a GDHCN Participant as having the primary "
"responsibility for the management of the Public Key Infrastructure, "
"including the generation of any needed public-private key pairs, and the "
"configuration and management of the connections between the GDHCN "
"Participant’s Public Key Infrastructure and the GDHCN Trust Network Gateway."
msgstr ""
"Personne identifiée par un participant au GDHCN comme ayant la "
"responsabilité principale de la gestion de l’infrastructure à clés "
"publiques, y compris de la création de toutes les paires de clés publique-"
"privée nécessaires, ainsi que de la configuration et de la gestion des "
"connexions entre l’infrastructure à clés publiques du participant au GDHCN "
"et la passerelle du réseau de confiance du GDHCN."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L93
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:93
msgid ""
"the open, interoperable technical specifications that identify or define the"
" applicable Trusted Services and Verifiable Digital Health Certificates; and"
msgstr ""
"les spécifications techniques ouvertes et interopérables qui identifient ou "
"définissent les services de confiance et les certificats de santé numériques"
" vérifiables applicables ; et"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L88
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:88
msgid ""
"The process and technical specifications regarding the management and use of"
" encryption keys for Verifiable Digital Health Certificates, Public Key "
"Infrastructure, and for securing connections with Trusted Services and the "
"Trust Network Gateway."
msgstr ""
"Processus et spécifications techniques relatifs à la gestion et à "
"l’utilisation des clés de chiffrement pour les certificats de santé "
"numériques vérifiables, l’infrastructure à clés publiques et la sécurisation"
" des connexions avec les services de confiance et la passerelle du réseau de"
" confiance."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L52
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:52
msgid ""
"The processes required for an Eligible GDHCN Participant to join the GDHCN "
"Trust Network. At the successful conclusion of the Onboarding Process, the "
"Eligible GDHCN Participant shall be considered a GDHCN Participant. "
"Sometimes simply referred to as “Onboarding”."
msgstr ""
"Processus requis pour qu’un acteur habilité à participer au GDHCN rejoigne "
"le réseau de confiance du GDHCN. À l’issue du processus d’intégration mené à"
" bien, l’acteur habilité à participer au GDHCN est considéré comme un "
"participant au GDHCN. Parfois simplement appelé « intégration »."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L137
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:137
msgid ""
"The public key certificate that a GDHCN Participant uses to sign data "
"packages that are uploaded to the TNG."
msgstr ""
"Le certificat de clé publique qu’un participant au GDHCN utilise pour signer"
" les paquets de données téléversés vers la TNG."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L67
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:67
msgid ""
"The Public Key Infrastructure (PKI) is the trust model based on public key "
"certificates and certificate authorities.  It is the means for publishing "
"and distributing Trust Lists comprising the public keys that can be used to "
"digitally verify the issuer of a Verifiable Digital Health Certificates."
msgstr ""
"L’infrastructure à clés publiques (PKI) est le modèle de confiance fondé sur"
" les certificats de clé publique et les autorités de certification.  Elle "
"constitue le moyen de publier et de distribuer des listes de confiance "
"comprenant les clés publiques qui peuvent être utilisées pour vérifier "
"numériquement l’émetteur d’un certificat de santé numérique vérifiable."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L151
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:151
msgid ""
"The specific Verifiable Digital Health Certificates are defined in the "
"Content Profiles"
msgstr ""
"Les certificats de santé numériques vérifiables spécifiques sont définis "
"dans les profils de contenu"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L134
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:134
msgid ""
"The TLS client authentication public key certificate of a GDHCN "
"Participant's Backend System."
msgstr ""
"Le certificat de clé publique d’authentification du client TLS du système "
"dorsal d’un participant au GDHCN."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L116
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:116
msgid "The TLS server public key certificate of the TNG."
msgstr "Le certificat de clé publique du serveur TLS de la TNG."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L113
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:113
msgid ""
"The Trust Anchor public key certificate of the TNG. The corresponding "
"private key is used to sign the list of all SCA certificates offline."
msgstr ""
"Le certificat de clé publique d’ancre de confiance de la TNG. La clé privée "
"correspondante est utilisée pour signer hors ligne la liste de tous les "
"certificats SCA."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L110
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:110
msgid ""
"The Trust Network Gateway (TNG) is the open-source software and its IT "
"operational infrastructure, utilizing open standards, for a Public Key "
"Infrastructure and metadata management services which is used to "
"operationalize one or more Trust Domains.  The Trust Network Gateway can be "
"interacted with using the API once a mTLS connection has been established."
msgstr ""
"La passerelle du réseau de confiance (TNG) est le logiciel libre et son "
"infrastructure informatique d’exploitation, reposant sur des normes "
"ouvertes, destinés à une infrastructure à clés publiques et à des services "
"de gestion des métadonnées, et utilisés pour rendre opérationnels un ou "
"plusieurs domaines de confiance.  Il est possible d’interagir avec la "
"passerelle du réseau de confiance au moyen de l’API une fois qu’une "
"connexion mTLS a été établie."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L18
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:18
msgid ""
"the United Nations (UN) and other intergovernmental organizations in "
"effective relations with WHO;"
msgstr ""
"l’Organisation des Nations Unies (ONU) et d’autres organisations "
"intergouvernementales entretenant des relations effectives avec l’OMS ;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L9
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:9
msgid ""
"The WHO Secretariat serves as the operational and management leadership of "
"the GDHCN, and in this role, the GDHCN Secretariat."
msgstr ""
"Le Secrétariat de l’OMS assure la direction opérationnelle et la gestion du "
"GDHCN et, à ce titre, est désigné sous le nom de Secrétariat du GDHCN."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L30
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:30
msgid ""
"TOP0 Sharing of necessary credentials to establish an mTLS (mutual transport"
" layer security) connection between a GDHCN Participant’s backend system(s) "
"and the Trust Network Gateway;"
msgstr ""
"TOP0 Partage des justificatifs d’identité nécessaires à l’établissement "
"d’une connexion mTLS (sécurité de la couche transport mutuelle) entre le ou "
"les systèmes dorsaux d’un participant au GDHCN et la passerelle du réseau de"
" confiance ;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L31
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:31
msgid ""
"TOP1 Compliance, during initial Onboarding Process and during routine "
"validation periods, with technical specifications required for a PKI;"
msgstr ""
"TOP1 Respect, au cours du processus d’intégration initial et pendant les "
"périodes de validation régulières, des spécifications techniques requises "
"pour une PKI ;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L32
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:32
msgid ""
"TOP2 Compliance, during initial Onboarding Process and during routine "
"validation periods, with technical specifications for Verifiable Digital "
"Health Certificates and APIs of Trusted Services for each applicable Trust "
"Domain;"
msgstr ""
"TOP2 Respect, au cours du processus d’intégration initial et pendant les "
"périodes de validation régulières, des spécifications techniques relatives "
"aux certificats de santé numériques vérifiables et aux API des services de "
"confiance pour chaque domaine de confiance applicable ;"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L33
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:33
msgid ""
"TOP3 Compliance with policy and regulatory standards that GDHCN Participants"
" pertaining to Trusted Services that a GDHCN Trust Participants operates or "
"utilizes for each applicable Trust Domain; and"
msgstr ""
"TOP3 Respect des normes politiques et réglementaires applicables aux "
"participants au GDHCN en ce qui concerne les services de confiance qu’un "
"participant au GDHCN exploite ou utilise pour chaque domaine de confiance "
"applicable ; et"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L34
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:34
msgid ""
"TOP4 Provision of supporting documentation (e.g. mandate, legal framework) "
"demonstrating that it is an Eligible GDHCN Participant, as may be requested "
"by WHO, at its sole discretion, from time to time."
msgstr ""
"TOP4 Fourniture de pièces justificatives (par exemple mandat, cadre "
"juridique) démontrant qu’il s’agit d’un acteur habilité à participer au "
"GDHCN, selon ce que l’OMS peut demander de temps à autre, à sa seule "
"discrétion."

