#: input/pagecontent/concepts.md:124
msgid ""
"Trust Network Participant - Data Exchange Certificate Authority  (TNPDECA)"
msgstr ""
"Participant au réseau de confiance – autorité de certification pour "
"l’échange de données  (TNPDECA)"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts.md#L130
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html
