"connectivity test should be the first action of the process. When "
"connectivity is successfully established the participant should execute "
"their acceptance tests. These acceptance tests must be performed on "
"dedicated test environment called User Acceptance Testing (UAT) which "
"already connects other trust network participants, that applied for "
"onboarding."
