#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md#L131
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-trust/concepts_onboarding.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding.md:131
msgid "transmitting On-boarding Requests to the Gateway Operations."
msgstr ""
"transmission des demandes d’intégration à l’équipe d’exploitation de la "
"passerelle."

