#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:1038
msgid ""
"If the merge contains only valid signed commits, the merge command will show"
" you all the signatures it has checked and then move forward with the merge."
msgstr ""
"Si la fusion ne contient que des commits signés valides, la commande merge "
"affichera toutes les signatures qu’elle a vérifiées, puis procédera à la "
"fusion."

