#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:417
msgid ""
"Important Recommendations for Prod: Please replace CAcert.pem and "
"CAprivkey.key with signing material from an officially Trusted Certification"
" Authority instead using your own self-signed one."
msgstr ""
"Recommandations importantes pour la production : veuillez remplacer "
"CAcert.pem et CAprivkey.key par du matériel de signature provenant d’une "
"autorité de certification officiellement reconnue comme de confiance, au "
"lieu d’utiliser votre propre matériel autosigné."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L1029
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:1029
msgid ""
"In Git 1.8.3 and later, git merge and git pull can be told to inspect and "
"reject when merging a commit that does not carry a trusted GPG signature "
"with the --verify-signatures command."
msgstr ""
"Dans Git 1.8.3 et les versions ultérieures, il est possible de demander à "
"git merge et git pull, au moyen de l’option --verify-signatures, d’inspecter"
" et de rejeter la fusion d’un commit qui ne porte pas de signature GPG de "
"confiance."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L988
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:988
msgid ""
"In more recent versions of Git (v1.7.9 and above), you can now also sign "
"individual commits. If you’re interested in signing commits directly instead"
" of just the tags, all you need to do is add a -S to your git commit "
"command."
msgstr ""
"Dans les versions plus récentes de Git (v1.7.9 et ultérieures), vous pouvez "
"également signer des commits individuels. Si vous souhaitez signer "
"directement les commits plutôt que seulement les étiquettes, il vous suffit "
"d’ajouter -S à votre commande git commit."

