msgstr "Autorisations relatives au réseau et au pare-feu"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L484
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:484
msgid ""
"Note :Beware that self-signed certificates should also contain the key usage"
" Certificate signing (keyCertSign), so that the (self) signature of the "
"certificate can be verified."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : n’oubliez pas que les certificats autosignés devraient également "
"contenir l’utilisation de clé Signature de certificat (keyCertSign), afin "
"que la signature (auto-apposée) du certificat puisse être vérifiée."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L315
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:315
msgid ""
"Note: keep your private keys safe and secure. Do not share them with anyone."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : conservez vos clés privées en lieu sûr. Ne les communiquez à "
"personne."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L324
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:324
msgid ""
"Note: On DEV and UAT environment, if the files are generated using a script,"
" delete the generated folder before committing the files."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : dans les environnements DEV et UAT, si les fichiers sont générés "
"au moyen d’un script, supprimez le dossier généré avant d’effectuer le "
"commit des fichiers."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L265
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
