#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:265
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:285
msgid ""
"Note: OSSLCOUNTRYNAME should be ISO 2 letter name of the country mapped to "
"the name used in repository."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : OSSLCOUNTRYNAME devrait être le code ISO à 2 lettres du pays, "
"correspondant au nom utilisé dans le référentiel."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L682
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:682
msgid ""
"Note: Replace domain, group, and EndpointURL with the appropriate values for"
" your onboarding environment."
msgstr ""
"Remarque : remplacez domain, group et EndpointURL par les valeurs "
"appropriées pour votre environnement d’intégration."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L758
