msgid ""
"Once you execute the script. It will generate all certificates and keys in a"
" subfolder named by current datetime."
msgstr ""
"Une fois le script exécuté, il générera tous les certificats et clés dans un"
" sous-dossier portant comme nom la date et l’heure courantes."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md#L912
