#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_checklist.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_checklist.md:884
msgid ""
"Once you receive the CA-signed certificate, you will use it instead of "
"generating a new self-signed certificate. Here’s how you can replace the "
"placeholders with the signed certificate: cp signedCAcert.pem "
"${subdir}/CAcert.pem cp CAprivkey.key ${subdir}/CAprivkey.key"
msgstr ""
"Une fois que vous aurez reçu le certificat signé par l’autorité de "
"certification, vous l’utiliserez au lieu de générer un nouveau certificat "
"autosigné. Voici comment remplacer les fichiers provisoires par le "
"certificat signé : cp signedCAcert.pem ${subdir}/CAcert.pem cp CAprivkey.key"
" ${subdir}/CAprivkey.key"

