#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L106
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:106
msgid ""
"1) Certificates must be prepared for all environments (self-signed allowed) "
"following the requirements in Certificate Governance - Authentication: "
"TNPTLS - Upload: TNPUP - SCA(s): TNPSCA"
msgstr ""
"1) Les certificats doivent être préparés pour tous les environnements (les "
"certificats autosignés sont autorisés) conformément aux exigences de la "
"gouvernance des certificats – Authentification : TNPTLS – Téléversement : "
"TNPUP – SCA : TNPSCA"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L289
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:289
msgid "1) check the connectivity with the following command:   input:"
msgstr ""
"1) vérifier la connectivité au moyen de la commande suivante :   entrée :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L117
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:117
msgid ""
"2) Prepare public keys in PEM format in your private GitHub repository (see "
"[11]) dedicated to the used environment keys."
msgstr ""
"2) Préparer les clés publiques au format PEM dans votre référentiel GitHub "
"privé (voir [11]) dédié aux clés de l’environnement utilisé."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L324
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:324
msgid ""
"2) Test the other Trustlist Routes in the same style (e. g. with "
"DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…)"
msgstr ""
"2) Tester de la même manière les autres routes de la liste de confiance (par"
" exemple avec DSC/SCA/Upload/Authentication…)"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L119
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:119
msgid "3) The prepared public keys must be tagged by the generated GPG keys:"
msgstr ""
"3) Les clés publiques préparées doivent être étiquetées (tag) au moyen des "
"clés GPG générées :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L159
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:159
msgid "3-digit ISO Participant code"
msgstr "Code ISO à 3 chiffres du participant"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L194
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:194
msgid "3-digit ISO participant code of the TNP"
msgstr "Code ISO à 3 chiffres du participant du TNP"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L125
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:125
msgid "[10] Create the GPG keys per environment and per each user needed."
msgstr ""
"[10] Créer les clés GPG pour chaque environnement et pour chaque utilisateur"
" nécessaire."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L131
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:131
msgid "[11] The TNP creates the private GitHub repositories per environment"
msgstr ""
"[11] Le TNP crée les référentiels GitHub privés pour chaque environnement"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L138
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:138
msgid ""
"[12] Upon GitHub repository creation and invitation to GitHub bot user to "
"WHO is sent, validity for accepting this invitation is 7 days by default. If"
" no action is taken it loses validity."
msgstr ""
"[12] Une fois le référentiel GitHub créé et l’invitation envoyée à "
"l’utilisateur bot GitHub de l’OMS, cette invitation peut être acceptée "
"pendant 7 jours par défaut. Si aucune suite n’y est donnée, elle perd sa "
"validité."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L140
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:140
msgid ""
"[13] Invitation for GitHub bot user must be accepted by WHO within 7 days "
"since invitation was emitted."
msgstr ""
"[13] L’invitation destinée à l’utilisateur bot GitHub doit être acceptée par"
" l’OMS dans un délai de 7 jours à compter de son émission."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L153
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:153
msgid ""
"[14] TNP is ready for onboarding according to WHO requirements and "
"governance and has collected the following information in the Letter of "
"Application [Document 16]:"
msgstr ""
"[14] Le TNP est prêt pour l’intégration conformément aux exigences et à la "
"gouvernance de l’OMS et a rassemblé les informations suivantes dans la "
"lettre de candidature [Document 16] :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L163
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:163
msgid ""
"[15] The Letter of Application is received and processed by WHO. The TNP ."
msgstr ""
"[15] La lettre de candidature est reçue et traitée par l’OMS. Le TNP ."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L165
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:165
msgid ""
"[16 - 17] The verification and confirmation of the named people that are "
"allowed to provide the key material for the TNP takes place through either "
"of different channels:"
msgstr ""
"[16 - 17] La vérification et la confirmation des personnes nommément "
"désignées qui sont autorisées à fournir le matériel cryptographique du TNP "
"s’effectuent par l’une ou l’autre des voies suivantes :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L174
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:174
msgid ""
"[18] WHO acknowledges the Letter of Application and proceeds to validate the"
" provided data. At this stage verification of rules compliance takes place. "
"Verification is in detailed according to process and individuals involved in"
" the request."
msgstr ""
"[18] L’OMS accuse réception de la lettre de candidature et procède à la "
"validation des données fournies. À ce stade, la conformité aux règles est "
"vérifiée. La vérification est détaillée en fonction du processus et des "
"personnes concernées par la demande."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L176
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:176
msgid ""
"[19] In case the compliance rules verification failed, WHO need to inform "
"the TNP by email."
msgstr ""
"[19] Si la vérification de la conformité aux règles échoue, l’OMS doit en "
"informer le TNP par courrier électronique."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L73
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:73
msgid ""
"[1] The eligible Trust Network Participant (TNP) has to submit its Statement"
" of Interest [link to the form. [Document 5] ] to gdhcn-support@who.int ."
msgstr ""
"[1] Le participant au réseau de confiance (TNP) habilité doit soumettre sa "
"déclaration d’intérêt [lien vers le formulaire. [Document 5] ] à gdhcn-"
"support@who.int ."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L75
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:75
msgid ""
"[2 – 3] WHO validates all provided data and verify that such a data follows "
"WHO compliance with Trusted Network Terms of Participation (TOP 0 – 3) "
"https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html as well as: Participant´s "
"eligibility criteria, governmental entity/health agency, contact details of "
"approvers and individuals. [See Elegibility Criteria]. [Document 16]"
msgstr ""
"[2 – 3] L’OMS valide toutes les données fournies et vérifie qu’elles sont "
"conformes aux conditions de participation au réseau de confiance (TOP 0 – 3)"
" https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts.html, ainsi qu’aux éléments suivants :"
" critères d’habilitation du participant, entité gouvernementale/agence "
"sanitaire, coordonnées des approbateurs et des personnes. [Voir les critères"
" d’habilitation]. [Document 16]"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L178
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:178
msgid ""
"[20] The TNP receive an email with information indicating that validations "
"failed. Corrective activities have to be taken."
msgstr ""
"[20] Le TNP reçoit un courrier électronique indiquant que les validations "
"ont échoué. Des mesures correctives doivent être prises."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L180
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:180
msgid ""
"[21] WHO is checking for each provided GPG key, if the given email address "
"is included in the GPG key."
msgstr ""
"[21] Pour chaque clé GPG fournie, l’OMS vérifie si l’adresse électronique "
"indiquée figure dans la clé GPG."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L182
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:182
msgid "[22] Validate that GPG key matches cryptographic/governance criteria"
msgstr ""
"[22] Valider que la clé GPG satisfait aux critères cryptographiques et de "
"gouvernance"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L188
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:188
msgid ""
"[23] WHO is collecting the required information to be provided to the "
"operations team (OPS):"
msgstr ""
"[23] L’OMS rassemble les informations requises à fournir à l’équipe des "
"opérations (OPS) :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L227
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:227
msgid ""
"[30] The collected onboarding information is sent to the operations (OPS) "
"team. The onboarding (OB) team is informed as well."
msgstr ""
"[30] Les informations d’intégration rassemblées sont envoyées à l’équipe des"
" opérations (OPS). L’équipe chargée de l’intégration (OB) en est également "
"informée."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L229
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:229
msgid ""
"[31 - 35] The onboarding data is taken over to the configuration files by "
"the OPS team to automate the GitHub processes. As a result, a Pull Request "
"(PR) is created. Dependent on the environment, the subsequent steps differ."
msgstr ""
"[31 - 35] Les données d’intégration sont reportées par l’équipe OPS dans les"
" fichiers de configuration afin d’automatiser les processus GitHub. Une "
"demande de tirage (pull request, PR) est alors créée. Les étapes suivantes "
"diffèrent selon l’environnement."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L231
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:231
msgid ""
"[36 -37] For PROD environment, the PR is verified by WHO. After successful "
"verification, the air-gapped signing process is performed to sign the keys. "
"Follow to [47]"
msgstr ""
"[36 -37] Pour l’environnement PROD, la PR est vérifiée par l’OMS. Une fois "
"la vérification réussie, le processus de signature isolé (air-gapped) est "
"exécuté pour signer les clés. Passer à [47]"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L233
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:233
msgid ""
"[38] For UAT (and optional DEV), an auto signing process signs the keys."
msgstr ""
"[38] Pour l’UAT (et, facultativement, le DEV), un processus de signature "
"automatique signe les clés."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L235
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:235
msgid "[39] The service provider checks the PR as well."
msgstr "[39] Le prestataire de services vérifie également la PR."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L79
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:79
msgid ""
"[4 - 5] In case no compliance with WHO governance rules is given, the "
"application is rejected. The rejection is communicated to the TNP by email."
msgstr ""
"[4 - 5] Si les règles de gouvernance de l’OMS ne sont pas respectées, la "
"candidature est rejetée. Le rejet est communiqué au TNP par courrier "
"électronique."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L239
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:239
msgid ""
"[40 - 41] In case the verification failed, WHO is informed about the "
"outcome."
msgstr "[40 - 41] Si la vérification échoue, l’OMS est informée du résultat."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L243
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:243
msgid "[42] Correction."
msgstr "[42] Correction."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L277
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:277
msgid ""
"[43] In case the verification was successful the whitelisting of the "
"certificates is initiated."
msgstr ""
"[43] Si la vérification a abouti, l’inscription des certificats sur liste "
"blanche est engagée."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L281
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:281
msgid ""
"[44 - 46] and the participant will be informed that the preparation has been"
" completed successfully."
msgstr ""
"[44 - 46] et le participant est informé que la préparation a été menée à "
"bien."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L237
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:237
msgid "[47] TSI Verification of Pull Request in PROD Environment."
msgstr ""
"[47] Vérification par TSI de la demande de tirage dans l’environnement PROD."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L241
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:241
msgid ""
"[48 - 50] In case Pull Request failed, TSIS to communicate to Participant "
"for them to Correct"
msgstr ""
"[48 - 50] En cas d’échec de la demande de tirage, TSIS doit en informer le "
"participant pour qu’il apporte les corrections nécessaires"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L285
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:285
msgid ""
"[60] The participant is connecting to UAT environment and the following "
"steps has to be performed to check the connection:"
msgstr ""
"[60] Le participant se connecte à l’environnement UAT et les étapes "
"suivantes doivent être effectuées pour vérifier la connexion :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L328
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:328
msgid ""
"[61] In case the connection fails, some corrective actions must be performed"
" to analyze and solve the issue(s). The operations team is supporting the "
"TNP."
msgstr ""
"[61] Si la connexion échoue, des mesures correctives doivent être prises "
"pour analyser et résoudre le ou les problèmes. L’équipe des opérations "
"apporte son appui au TNP."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L332
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:332
msgid ""
"[62] After the connection to the TNG is established the participant can "
"start the dry run test on UAT."
msgstr ""
"[62] Une fois la connexion à la TNG établie, le participant peut commencer "
"l’essai à blanc dans l’UAT."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L391
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:391
msgid ""
"[63] After executing all required steps, the participant must provide the "
"test results to the onboarding team."
msgstr ""
"[63] Après avoir exécuté toutes les étapes requises, le participant doit "
"communiquer les résultats des tests à l’équipe chargée de l’intégration."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L395
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:395
msgid ""
"[64 - 65] The onboarding team checks the results and provides feedback to "
"the participant."
msgstr ""
"[64 - 65] L’équipe chargée de l’intégration vérifie les résultats et fait "
"part de ses observations au participant."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L399
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:399
msgid ""
"[66] In case of any issues additional corrective actions are bespoken and "
"solved with the participant."
msgstr ""
"[66] En cas de problème, des mesures correctives supplémentaires sont "
"convenues et mises en œuvre avec le participant."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L279
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:279
msgid ""
"[67] If the Dry Run Test has passed successfully, the whitelisting of the "
"certificates in the gateway (PROD environment) continues."
msgstr ""
"[67] Si l’essai à blanc est concluant, l’inscription des certificats sur "
"liste blanche dans la passerelle (environnement PROD) se poursuit."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L283
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:283
msgid ""
"[68 - 69] The Onboarding team informs the TNP to be ready to connect to TNG "
"PROD environment."
msgstr ""
"[68 - 69] L’équipe chargée de l’intégration informe le TNP qu’il doit se "
"tenir prêt à se connecter à l’environnement PROD de la TNG."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L81
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:81
msgid "[6] TNP needs to modify the data they shared with WHO and re-apply it."
msgstr ""
"[6] Le TNP doit modifier les données qu’il a communiquées à l’OMS et "
"présenter une nouvelle demande."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L326
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:326
msgid ""
"[70] The participant is allowed and enabled to connect to TNG PROD "
"environment (for detailed information see [60])."
msgstr ""
"[70] Le participant est autorisé et habilité à se connecter à "
"l’environnement PROD de la TNG (pour des informations détaillées, voir "
"[60])."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L330
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:330
msgid ""
"[71] In case the connection fails, some corrective actions must be performed"
" to analyze and solve the issue(s). The operations team is supporting the "
"TNP."
msgstr ""
"[71] Si la connexion échoue, des mesures correctives doivent être prises "
"pour analyser et résoudre le ou les problèmes. L’équipe des opérations "
"apporte son appui au TNP."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L348
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:348
msgid ""
"[72] After the connection to the TNG PROD is established the Production "
"Readiness Test can start."
msgstr ""
"[72] Une fois la connexion à la TNG PROD établie, le test de préparation à "
"la mise en production peut commencer."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L393
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:393
msgid ""
"[73 - 74] After executing all required steps, the participant must provide "
"the test results to the service provider by mail."
msgstr ""
"[73 - 74] Après avoir exécuté toutes les étapes requises, le participant "
"doit communiquer les résultats des tests au prestataire de services par "
"courrier électronique."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L397
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:397
msgid "[75] The service provider checks the results."
msgstr "[75] Le prestataire de services vérifie les résultats."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L401
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:401
msgid ""
"[76] and in case of any issues additional corrective actions are bespoken "
"and solved with the participant."
msgstr ""
"[76] et, en cas de problème, des mesures correctives supplémentaires sont "
"convenues et mises en œuvre avec le participant."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L264
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:264
msgid ""
"[77 - 80] After passing the Production Readiness Test, the participant is "
"allowed to use the TNG PROD environment. A confirmation email is sent to the"
" participant and to WHO with the confirmation about the successfully passed "
"test and the completion of the onboarding process."
msgstr ""
"[77 - 80] Une fois le test de préparation à la mise en production réussi, le"
" participant est autorisé à utiliser l’environnement PROD de la TNG. Un "
"courrier électronique de confirmation est envoyé au participant et à l’OMS "
"pour confirmer la réussite du test et l’achèvement du processus "
"d’intégration."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L83
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:83
msgid ""
"[7] If the WHO’s technical team gives a positive opinion, the eligible Trust"
" Network Participant will be invited to start the onboarding process. The "
"following information is included:"
msgstr ""
"[7] Si l’équipe technique de l’OMS émet un avis favorable, le participant au"
" réseau de confiance habilité sera invité à engager le processus "
"d’intégration. Les informations suivantes sont incluses :"

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L89
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:89
msgid ""
"[8] The TNP receives the confirmation and necessary technical information to"
" connect to the TNG and register the certificates."
msgstr ""
"[8] Le TNP reçoit la confirmation et les informations techniques nécessaires"
" pour se connecter à la TNG et enregistrer les certificats."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L104
#. URL: http://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#. URL: https://litlfred.github.io/smart-
#. trust/concepts_onboarding_process_full.html
#: input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md:104
msgid ""
"[9] Create certificates per environment. Details can be found here: "
"https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_CertificatePreperation.html"
msgstr ""
"[9] Créer les certificats pour chaque environnement. Des précisions sont "
"disponibles ici : "
"https://smart.who.int/trust/concepts_CertificatePreperation.html"

