"Framework IX. Calls: no other process. Called by: Verify the Letter of "
"Application, Change the keys or the representatives. BPMN file: "
"GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn."
msgstr ""
"Cadre, IX. Appelle : aucun autre processus. Appelé par : Vérifier la lettre "
"de candidature, Changer les clés ou les représentants. Fichier BPMN : "
"GDHCN.ONB.ConveyLetter.bpmn."

#. Source: https://github.com/litlfred/smart-
#. trust/blob/main/input/pagecontent/concepts_onboarding_process_full.md#L435
